Cp-CT  297.000     1.50100        ! from conste (Henriques 2013)
CD-HC  338.000     1.09000        ! from conste (Henriques 2013)
FO-S         33.33    2.4671        ! Seminario ferric, axial Met S (NEW vs conste)

ANGLE
NB-FO-NB     0.000     180.000        ! from conste
